  "notes": "{熟考|じゅっこう} means to think deeply and carefully, often used for important decisions.\n\nWRITING:\n- {熟|じゅく} (mature, ripen, master)\n- {考|こう} (think, consider)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {熟考|じゅっこう}する (to deliberate - suru verb)\n- {熟考|じゅっこう}の{末|すえ} (after careful consideration)\n- {熟考|じゅっこう}を{重|かさ}ねる (to deliberate repeatedly)\n\nREGISTER:\n- Slightly formal/written style\n- Common in business and academic contexts\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {熟慮|じゅくりょ} (careful consideration - more formal)\n- よく{考|かんが}える (to think carefully - casual)\n- {検討|けんとう}する (to examine/consider)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {一考|いっこう}に{値|あたい}する (worth considering)\n- {再考|さいこう} (reconsideration)",
